      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the docs, I\u0027m seeing gpio-cells only used for GPIO controllers and with positive numbers of cells. Why are these necessary?",
      "revId": "e434b9a5c433e7267536ba9ee979aa22aefd3b98",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
